# An ungoverned report must have no policy and every count zero.
MODULE: UngovernedReportEmptyCarriesRules
TARGET: UngovernedReportEmpty
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an ungoverned tree's report carries a rule count
PERTURBS: Start

--- FIND
            /\ repRuleCount' = 0 /\ repReasons' = 0
--- REPLACE
            /\ repRuleCount' = 1 /\ repReasons' = 0
--- END
